			title: "Uzbekistan Essentials: A Silk Road Adventure, 6 days (Private)",
			description:
				"Discover the timeless beauty of Uzbekistan on a fascinating journey through its most iconic cities. This 6-day adventure takes you from vibrant Tashkent to legendary Samarkand and historic Bukhara — the heart of the ancient Silk Road.\n\nExplore impressive Islamic architecture, colorful bazaars, UNESCO World Heritage sites, and centuries-old traditions. Wander through the majestic squares of Samarkand, discover the atmospheric old streets of Bukhara, and experience the dynamic blend of modern life and rich heritage in Tashkent.\n\nThis journey offers the perfect introduction to Uzbekistan's culture, history, cuisine, and legendary hospitality.",
